flowchart TD
 A[User supplies forecast and metadata] --> B[Validate required input]
 B --> C[Select one of two prompt options]
 C --> D1[Baseline]
 C --> D2[Structured]
 D1 --> E[Backend prepares selected prompt]
 D2 --> E
 E --> F[Rule-based mock advisory]
 F --> G[Heuristic checks]
 G --> H[Human review against supplied forecast]
 H --> I[Follow official local guidance before public distribution]
